WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Mountain Pose — with Hani

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Breathe in... Stand tall. Feet together.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.000
Breathe out... Arms by your sides.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.800
Breathe in... Palms face forward.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.800
Breathe out... Feel your feet on the floor.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.600
Breathe in... Grow tall like a mountain.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:34.000
Breathe out... Shoulders soft and low.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.700
Breathe in... Fill up slowly.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:43.200
Breathe out... Let it all go.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:48.700
Breathe in... Feel strong and steady.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:52.400
Breathe out... Feel calm inside.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:57.800
Breathe in... Like a big mountain.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.600
Breathe out... Nothing can push you over.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:06.600
Breathe in... Slow and deep.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.400
Breathe out... Nice and slow.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:14.900
Breathe in... Your mountain is strong.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:20.400
Breathe out... Your mountain is calm.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:29.400
Fun fact! Mountains stay steady and strong, even when the wind blows!

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:34.900
Breathe in... Close your eyes, or look down.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:39.400
Breathe out... Soft, quiet body.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:43.200
Breathe in... Feel the sun on your mountain.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:48.200
Breathe out... Let the clouds float by.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:52.000
Breathe in... Breathe in calm.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:57.400
Breathe out... Breathe out worries.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:01.100
Breathe in... Tall and proud.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:06.600
Breathe out... Steady and still.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:12.100
Breathe in... Almost done.

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:15.800
Breathe out... Slow and easy.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:21.200
Breathe in... One more big breath.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.000
Breathe out... All the way out.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Breathe in... Wiggle your fingers.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.800
Breathe out... Open your eyes.

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:38.300
Breathe in... You are a mountain!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:43.800
Breathe out... Great job, friend!

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:49.800
Nice work! You did Mountain Pose. HudsonSeed · Hani
